# GBG Calculator

A simple Windows Forms calculator built using C#.

## Features
- Basic arithmetic operations (+, −, ×, ÷)
- Advanced functions (√, x², 1/x, %)
- Decimal input support
- Backspace, Clear Entry, and Full Clear options
- Calculation history panel
- Handles division by zero with error message
- Dynamic display resizing for long numbers

## How to Run
1. Open the project in Visual Studio
2. Build the solution
3. Run the application (Start Debugging or F5)

## Project Type
- Windows Forms Application (.NET Framework / .NET)
